      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The successful percutaneous obliteration of a left main coronary artery aneurysm using a covered stent (JOMED) is described. The immediate angiographic result was excellent and the early post-procedural period was uneventful. Six-month follow-up angiography revealed no changes."},
